{title: Christ Is Enough (FJ_141_en)}
{subtitle: Du bist genug}
{song_number: 141}
{language: en}
{tempo: 82}
{key: G}

{start_of_verse: 1}
[Em]Christ is my reward [C]and all of my devotion.
[G]Now there's [D/F#]noth[Em]ing in this world [C]that could ever satisfy.
[D/F#]Through ev'ry [Bm]trial, [C]my soul will [D]sing:
[Em]No turning [G/B]back, [C]I've been set [D]free.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus}
[G]Christ is enough for me, [Em7]Christ is enough for [D]me.
[C]Ev'rything I need [D]is in [Em]You,
[C]ev'rything I [D]need.
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: 2}
[Em]Christ, my all in all, [C]the joy of my salvation.
[G]And this [D/F#]hope [Em]will never fail, [C]heaven is our home.
[D/F#]Through ev'ry [Bm]storm, [C]my soul will [D]sing:
[Em]Jesus is [G/B]here, [C]to God be the [D]glory.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus}
[G]Christ is enough for me, [Em7]Christ is enough for [D]me.
[C]Ev'rything I need [D]is in [Em]You,
[C]ev'rything I [D]need.
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_bridge}
[G]I have decided [Gsus4]to follow [G]Jesus.
No turning [C]back, [Cmaj7]no turning [D]back.
[Em]The cross before me, [C]the world behind me.
[D]No turning [Em]back, [C]no turning [D]back.
{end_of_bridge}

{start_of_chorus}
[G]Christ is enough for me, [Em7]Christ is enough for [D]me.
[C]Ev'rything I need [D]is in [Em]You,
[C]ev'rything I [D]need.
{end_of_chorus}
